*
!.gitignore
# The real, committed datasets are re-included here as well as in the root
# .gitignore: the `*` above is the deepest matching rule, so without these
# negations a freshly prepared dataset folder is invisible to `git add`.
!multi_galaxy/
!multi_galaxy/sdssj1011+0143/
!multi_galaxy/sdssj1011+0143/**
multi_galaxy/sdssj1011+0143/__pycache__/
